{"seq":3,"slug":"memory-management","title":"内存管理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/webassembly/rust-to-wasm/memory-management","wordCount":908,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"内存管理\">内存管理</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>Rust 编译到 WASM 后，与 JS 共享同一块<strong>线性内存</strong>：JS 通过 <code>memory.buffer</code> 拿到 <code>ArrayBuffer</code> 视图，即可与 WASM 侧的指针直接对话。围绕这块内存，<code>js-sys</code> 覆盖 JS 内置 API、<code>web-sys</code> 覆盖 Web API（按 Cargo feature 引入，避免产物膨胀）。跨边界传递数据时，字符串需要 UTF-8/UTF-16 拷贝，而 <code>&amp;[u8]</code> 切片与 <code>TypedArray::view()</code> 可实现<strong>零拷贝</strong>，<code>serde-wasm-bindgen</code> 则直接对 <code>JsValue</code> 序列化复杂类型。核心陷阱是 <code>memory.grow</code> 会让既有视图失效，必须重新获取。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"线性内存共享\">线性内存共享</h2><p>Rust WASM 模块和 JavaScript 共享同一块线性内存。理解这块共享内存的布局和访问模式是避免 bug 的关键。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    subgraph 线性内存&#10;        STACK[&quot;栈区&lt;br/&gt;(Rust 局部变量)&quot;]&#10;        HEAP[&quot;堆区&lt;br/&gt;(Rust 动态分配)&quot;]&#10;        DATA[&quot;数据段&lt;br/&gt;(静态数据)&quot;]&#10;        FREE[&quot;空闲区域&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;    RUST[&quot;Rust 代码&quot;] --&gt; STACK&#10;    RUST --&gt; HEAP&#10;    JS[&quot;JavaScript&quot;] --&gt;|&quot;memory.buffer&quot;| HEAP&#10;    JS --&gt;|&quot;TypedArray 视图&quot;| DATA\">graph LR\n    subgraph 线性内存\n        STACK[\"栈区&lt;br/&gt;(Rust 局部变量)\"]\n        HEAP[\"堆区&lt;br/&gt;(Rust 动态分配)\"]\n        DATA[\"数据段&lt;br/&gt;(静态数据)\"]\n        FREE[\"空闲区域\"]\n    end\n    RUST[\"Rust 代码\"] --&gt; STACK\n    RUST --&gt; HEAP\n    JS[\"JavaScript\"] --&gt;|\"memory.buffer\"| HEAP\n    JS --&gt;|\"TypedArray 视图\"| DATA</pre><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"rust\" data-code=\"use wasm_bindgen::prelude::*;&#10;&#10;#[wasm_bindgen]&#10;pub fn allocate(size: usize) -&gt; *mut u8 {&#10;    let mut buf = Vec::with_capacity(size);&#10;    let ptr = buf.as_mut_ptr();&#10;    std::mem::forget(buf);&#10;    ptr&#10;}&#10;&#10;#[wasm_bindgen]&#10;pub fn deallocate(ptr: *mut u8, size: usize) {&#10;    unsafe { let _ = Vec::from_raw_parts(ptr, 0, size); }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>use wasm_bindgen::prelude::*;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>#[wasm_bindgen]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>pub fn allocate(size: usize) -> *mut u8 {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    let mut buf = Vec::with_capacity(size);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    let ptr = buf.as_mut_ptr();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    std::mem::forget(buf);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    ptr</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>#[wasm_bindgen]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>pub fn deallocate(ptr: *mut u8, size: usize) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    unsafe { let _ = Vec::from_raw_parts(ptr, 0, size); }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>内存区域</th>\n<th>管理者</th>\n<th>JS 可访问</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>栈区</td>\n<td>Rust 编译器</td>\n<td>不建议</td>\n<td>函数局部变量，自动回收</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>堆区</td>\n<td>Rust alloc</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td><code>Box</code>/<code>Vec</code> 等动态分配</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>数据段</td>\n<td>WASM 加载器</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>静态字符串和常量</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>空闲区域</td>\n<td>无</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td><code>memory.grow</code> 后的新页面</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> 永远不要从 JS 侧直接写入 Rust 正在使用的堆内存，除非你通过导出的函数获取了明确的指针和长度。Rust 的分配器不知道外部修改，可能导致 use-after-free 或双重释放。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"js-sys-与-web-sys\">js-sys 与 web-sys</h2><p><code>js-sys</code> 和 <code>web-sys</code> 是 wasm-bindgen 生态中两个核心的 Rust 绑定库，分别对应 JavaScript 内置 API 和 Web API。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"rust\" data-code=\"use js_sys::{Array, Date, Map, Promise, Reflect};&#10;use wasm_bindgen::prelude::*;&#10;use wasm_bindgen_futures::JsFuture;&#10;use web_sys::{console, Document, Element, Window};&#10;&#10;#[wasm_bindgen]&#10;pub fn create_element(tag: &amp;str) -&gt; Result&lt;Element, JsValue&gt; {&#10;    let window: Window = web_sys::window().unwrap();&#10;    let document: Document = window.document().unwrap();&#10;    document.create_element(tag)&#10;}&#10;&#10;#[wasm_bindgen]&#10;pub async fn fetch_data(url: &amp;str) -&gt; Result&lt;JsValue, JsValue&gt; {&#10;    let window = web_sys::window().unwrap();&#10;    let resp_value = JsFuture::from(window.fetch_with_str(url)).await?;&#10;    let resp: web_sys::Response = resp_value.dyn_into()?;&#10;    JsFuture::from(resp.json()?).await&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>use js_sys::{Array, Date, Map, Promise, Reflect};</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>use wasm_bindgen::prelude::*;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>use wasm_bindgen_futures::JsFuture;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>use web_sys::{console, Document, Element, Window};</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>#[wasm_bindgen]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>pub fn create_element(tag: &#x26;str) -> Result&#x3C;Element, JsValue> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    let window: Window = web_sys::window().unwrap();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    let document: Document = window.document().unwrap();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    document.create_element(tag)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>#[wasm_bindgen]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>pub async fn fetch_data(url: &#x26;str) -> Result&#x3C;JsValue, JsValue> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    let window = web_sys::window().unwrap();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    let resp_value = JsFuture::from(window.fetch_with_str(url)).await?;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    let resp: web_sys::Response = resp_value.dyn_into()?;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    JsFuture::from(resp.json()?).await</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>库</th>\n<th>覆盖范围</th>\n<th>Cargo feature 控制</th>\n<th>大小影响</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>js-sys</code></td>\n<td>JS 内置对象（Array/Map）</td>\n<td>全量引入</td>\n<td>较小</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>web-sys</code></td>\n<td>Web API（DOM/Fetch）</td>\n<td>按 feature 精确控制</td>\n<td>按需引入</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"toml\" data-code=\"# Cargo.toml - web-sys 按需引入&#10;[dependencies.web-sys]&#10;version = &quot;0.3&quot;&#10;features = [&quot;console&quot;, &quot;Document&quot;, &quot;Element&quot;, &quot;Window&quot;, &quot;Response&quot;]\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span># Cargo.toml - web-sys 按需引入</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>[dependencies.web-sys]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>version = \"0.3\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>features = [\"console\", \"Document\", \"Element\", \"Window\", \"Response\"]</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    WASM_BINDGEN[&quot;wasm-bindgen&quot;] --&gt; JS_SYS[&quot;js-sys&lt;br/&gt;JS 内置 API&quot;]&#10;    WASM_BINDGEN --&gt; WEB_SYS[&quot;web-sys&lt;br/&gt;Web API&quot;]&#10;    JS_SYS --&gt; ARRAY[&quot;Array&quot;]&#10;    JS_SYS --&gt; MAP[&quot;Map&quot;]&#10;    JS_SYS --&gt; PROMISE[&quot;Promise&quot;]&#10;    JS_SYS --&gt; DATE[&quot;Date&quot;]&#10;    WEB_SYS --&gt; DOM[&quot;DOM API&quot;]&#10;    WEB_SYS --&gt; FETCH[&quot;Fetch API&quot;]&#10;    WEB_SYS --&gt; CANVAS[&quot;Canvas API&quot;]&#10;    WEB_SYS --&gt; WORKER[&quot;Worker API&quot;]\">graph TD\n    WASM_BINDGEN[\"wasm-bindgen\"] --&gt; JS_SYS[\"js-sys&lt;br/&gt;JS 内置 API\"]\n    WASM_BINDGEN --&gt; WEB_SYS[\"web-sys&lt;br/&gt;Web API\"]\n    JS_SYS --&gt; ARRAY[\"Array\"]\n    JS_SYS --&gt; MAP[\"Map\"]\n    JS_SYS --&gt; PROMISE[\"Promise\"]\n    JS_SYS --&gt; DATE[\"Date\"]\n    WEB_SYS --&gt; DOM[\"DOM API\"]\n    WEB_SYS --&gt; FETCH[\"Fetch API\"]\n    WEB_SYS --&gt; CANVAS[\"Canvas API\"]\n    WEB_SYS --&gt; WORKER[\"Worker API\"]</pre><blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> <code>web-sys</code> 的 feature 数量极多（数千个）。只启用你实际使用的 feature，否则会显著增加编译时间。使用 <code>cargo doc --open</code> 检查可用的 feature 列表。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"字符串与数组传递\">字符串与数组传递</h2><p>字符串和数组是 Rust↔JS 边界最常见的传递类型，也是性能敏感的操作。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"rust\" data-code=\"use wasm_bindgen::prelude::*;&#10;&#10;#[wasm_bindgen]&#10;pub fn process_string(input: &amp;str) -&gt; String {&#10;    input.chars()&#10;        .filter(|c| c.is_alphanumeric())&#10;        .collect::&lt;String&gt;()&#10;        .to_uppercase()&#10;}&#10;&#10;#[wasm_bindgen]&#10;pub fn sum_array(data: &amp;[f64]) -&gt; f64 {&#10;    data.iter().sum()&#10;}&#10;&#10;#[wasm_bindgen]&#10;pub fn transform_pixels(pixels: &amp;mut [u8]) {&#10;    for chunk in pixels.chunks_exact_mut(4) {&#10;        let gray = (chunk[0] as f32 * 0.299&#10;            + chunk[1] as f32 * 0.587&#10;            + chunk[2] as f32 * 0.114) as u8;&#10;        chunk[0] = gray;&#10;        chunk[1] = gray;&#10;        chunk[2] = gray;&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>use wasm_bindgen::prelude::*;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>#[wasm_bindgen]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>pub fn process_string(input: &#x26;str) -> String {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    input.chars()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        .filter(|c| c.is_alphanumeric())</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        .collect::&#x3C;String>()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        .to_uppercase()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>#[wasm_bindgen]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>pub fn sum_array(data: &#x26;[f64]) -> f64 {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    data.iter().sum()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>#[wasm_bindgen]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>pub fn transform_pixels(pixels: &#x26;mut [u8]) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    for chunk in pixels.chunks_exact_mut(4) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        let gray = (chunk[0] as f32 * 0.299</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            + chunk[1] as f32 * 0.587</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            + chunk[2] as f32 * 0.114) as u8;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        chunk[0] = gray;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        chunk[1] = gray;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        chunk[2] = gray;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>传递方式</th>\n<th>性能</th>\n<th>适用类型</th>\n<th>内存行为</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>值拷贝</td>\n<td>最快</td>\n<td>数值类型</td>\n<td>无额外分配</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>切片引用 <code>&amp;[u8]</code></td>\n<td>快（零拷贝）</td>\n<td>字节数组</td>\n<td>临时视图</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>可变切片 <code>&amp;mut [u8]</code></td>\n<td>快（零拷贝）</td>\n<td>就地修改</td>\n<td>直接写入线性内存</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>String</code> 返回</td>\n<td>较慢</td>\n<td>字符串</td>\n<td>拷贝 + UTF 转换</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>Vec&lt;T&gt;</code> 返回</td>\n<td>较慢</td>\n<td>动态数组</td>\n<td>拷贝到 JS 堆</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"const wasm = await init();&#10;&#10;const pixels = new Uint8Array(width * height * 4);&#10;ctx.getImageData(0, 0, width, height, { storage: pixels });&#10;&#10;wasm.transform_pixels(pixels);&#10;&#10;ctx.putImageData(new ImageData(pixels, width, height), 0, 0);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> wasm</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> init</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> pixels</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Uint8Array</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(width </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> height </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 4</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">ctx.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">getImageData</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, width, height, { storage: pixels });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">wasm.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">transform_pixels</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(pixels);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">ctx.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">putImageData</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ImageData</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(pixels, width, height), </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"serde-wasm-bindgen\">serde-wasm-bindgen</h2><p><code>serde-wasm-bindgen</code> 允许在 Rust 和 JS 之间直接序列化/反序列化复杂数据结构，无需手动转换。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"rust\" data-code=\"use serde::{Deserialize, Serialize};&#10;use wasm_bindgen::prelude::*;&#10;&#10;#[derive(Serialize, Deserialize)]&#10;pub struct Config {&#10;    pub width: u32,&#10;    pub height: u32,&#10;    pub title: String,&#10;    pub features: Vec&lt;String&gt;,&#10;    pub theme: Theme,&#10;}&#10;&#10;#[derive(Serialize, Deserialize)]&#10;pub enum Theme {&#10;    Light,&#10;    Dark,&#10;    Custom(String),&#10;}&#10;&#10;#[wasm_bindgen]&#10;pub fn process_config(val: JsValue) -&gt; Result&lt;JsValue, JsValue&gt; {&#10;    let config: Config = serde_wasm_bindgen::from_value(val)?;&#10;&#10;    let processed = Config {&#10;        title: format!(&quot;[处理后] {}&quot;, config.title),&#10;        ..config&#10;    };&#10;&#10;    serde_wasm_bindgen::to_value(&amp;processed)&#10;        .map_err(|e| JsValue::from_str(&amp;e.to_string()))&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>use serde::{Deserialize, Serialize};</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>use wasm_bindgen::prelude::*;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>#[derive(Serialize, Deserialize)]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>pub struct Config {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    pub width: u32,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    pub height: u32,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    pub title: String,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    pub features: Vec&#x3C;String>,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    pub theme: Theme,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>#[derive(Serialize, Deserialize)]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>pub enum Theme {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    Light,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    Dark,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    Custom(String),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>#[wasm_bindgen]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>pub fn process_config(val: JsValue) -> Result&#x3C;JsValue, JsValue> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    let config: Config = serde_wasm_bindgen::from_value(val)?;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    let processed = Config {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        title: format!(\"[处理后] {}\", config.title),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        ..config</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    serde_wasm_bindgen::to_value(&#x26;processed)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        .map_err(|e| JsValue::from_str(&#x26;e.to_string()))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>方案</th>\n<th>序列化方式</th>\n<th>性能</th>\n<th>类型保真度</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>serde-wasm-bindgen</code></td>\n<td>直接 JsValue</td>\n<td>快</td>\n<td>高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>serde-json</code> + 字符串</td>\n<td>JSON 字符串</td>\n<td>慢（双重解析）</td>\n<td>中（字符串中转）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>手动转换</td>\n<td>逐字段映射</td>\n<td>最快</td>\n<td>完全控制</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"const config = {&#10;  width: 800,&#10;  height: 600,&#10;  title: &#39;我的应用&#39;,&#10;  features: [&#39;dark-mode&#39;, &#39;i18n&#39;],&#10;  theme: &#39;Dark&#39;,&#10;};&#10;&#10;const result = process_config(config);&#10;console.log(result.title);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> config</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  width: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">800</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  height: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">600</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  title: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'我的应用'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  features: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'dark-mode'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'i18n'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  theme: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'Dark'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">};</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> result</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> process_config</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(config);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">console.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">log</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(result.title);</span></span></code></pre></div><blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> <code>serde-wasm-bindgen</code> 直接操作 <code>JsValue</code>，避免了 JSON 字符串的中间步骤。对于包含 <code>Map</code>、<code>Set</code>、<code>Date</code> 等 JS 原生类型的数据，它比 <code>serde-json</code> 更准确。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"typed-arrays-与零拷贝\">Typed Arrays 与零拷贝</h2><p>利用 TypedArray 的共享视图可以实现 JS 和 WASM 之间的零拷贝数据交换。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"rust\" data-code=\"use js_sys::Float64Array;&#10;use wasm_bindgen::prelude::*;&#10;&#10;#[wasm_bindgen]&#10;pub struct DataProcessor {&#10;    buffer: Vec&lt;f64&gt;,&#10;}&#10;&#10;#[wasm_bindgen]&#10;impl DataProcessor {&#10;    #[wasm_bindgen(constructor)]&#10;    pub fn new(size: usize) -&gt; DataProcessor {&#10;        DataProcessor { buffer: vec![0.0; size] }&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    pub fn get_buffer_view(&amp;self) -&gt; Float64Array {&#10;        unsafe { Float64Array::view(&amp;self.buffer) }&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    pub fn compute_mean(&amp;self) -&gt; f64 {&#10;        let sum: f64 = self.buffer.iter().sum();&#10;        sum / self.buffer.len() as f64&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>use js_sys::Float64Array;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>use wasm_bindgen::prelude::*;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>#[wasm_bindgen]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>pub struct DataProcessor {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    buffer: Vec&#x3C;f64>,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>#[wasm_bindgen]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>impl DataProcessor {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    #[wasm_bindgen(constructor)]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    pub fn new(size: usize) -> DataProcessor {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        DataProcessor { buffer: vec![0.0; size] }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    pub fn get_buffer_view(&#x26;self) -> Float64Array {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        unsafe { Float64Array::view(&#x26;self.buffer) }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    pub fn compute_mean(&#x26;self) -> f64 {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        let sum: f64 = self.buffer.iter().sum();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        sum / self.buffer.len() as f64</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    JS[&quot;JS TypedArray&quot;] --&gt;|&quot;unsafe view()&quot;| SHARED[&quot;共享内存视图(零拷贝)&quot;]&#10;    SHARED --&gt; RUST[&quot;Rust Vec&lt;f64&gt;&quot;]\">graph TD\n    JS[\"JS TypedArray\"] --&gt;|\"unsafe view()\"| SHARED[\"共享内存视图(零拷贝)\"]\n    SHARED --&gt; RUST[\"Rust Vec&lt;f64&gt;\"]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>方式</th>\n<th>拷贝次数</th>\n<th>安全性</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>view()</code></td>\n<td>0</td>\n<td>⚠️ unsafe</td>\n<td>大数据、性能关键路径</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>切片传参 <code>&amp;[T]</code></td>\n<td>0-1</td>\n<td>✅ safe</td>\n<td>函数参数传递</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>to_vec()</code></td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>✅ safe</td>\n<td>需要所有权</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>手动拷贝</td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>✅ safe</td>\n<td>精确控制</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> <code>Float64Array::view()</code> 创建的视图指向 WASM 线性内存。如果 Rust 侧触发了 <code>memory.grow</code>（例如 <code>Vec</code> 扩容），视图的底层 <code>ArrayBuffer</code> 会被 detach，导致 JS 侧访问出错。使用 view 时确保不会触发内存增长。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"mindmap\" data-source=\"mindmap&#10;  root((内存管理))&#10;    线性内存共享&#10;      栈区/堆区/数据段&#10;      JS 通过 buffer 访问&#10;      避免直接写入&#10;    js-sys / web-sys&#10;      JS 内置 API 绑定&#10;      Web API 按需引入&#10;      feature 精确控制&#10;    字符串与数组&#10;      切片零拷贝&#10;      String 需拷贝&#10;      可变切片就地修改&#10;    serde-wasm-bindgen&#10;      直接 JsValue 转换&#10;      复杂类型序列化&#10;      优于 JSON 中转&#10;    TypedArray&#10;      零拷贝视图&#10;      memory.grow 陷阱&#10;      大数据高性能\">mindmap\n  root((内存管理))\n    线性内存共享\n      栈区/堆区/数据段\n      JS 通过 buffer 访问\n      避免直接写入\n    js-sys / web-sys\n      JS 内置 API 绑定\n      Web API 按需引入\n      feature 精确控制\n    字符串与数组\n      切片零拷贝\n      String 需拷贝\n      可变切片就地修改\n    serde-wasm-bindgen\n      直接 JsValue 转换\n      复杂类型序列化\n      优于 JSON 中转\n    TypedArray\n      零拷贝视图\n      memory.grow 陷阱\n      大数据高性能</pre><ul>\n<li>Rust WASM 和 JS 共享<strong>线性内存</strong>，JS 通过 <code>memory.buffer</code> 获取 <code>ArrayBuffer</code> 视图。</li>\n<li><code>js-sys</code> 覆盖 JS 内置 API，<code>web-sys</code> 覆盖 Web API 并通过 <strong>Cargo feature</strong> 按需引入。</li>\n<li>字符串传递需要 UTF-8/UTF-16 拷贝，<strong>切片引用 <code>&amp;[u8]</code></strong> 可实现函数参数的零拷贝传递。</li>\n<li><code>serde-wasm-bindgen</code> 直接操作 JsValue 序列化复杂类型，避免 JSON 字符串的双重解析。</li>\n<li><code>TypedArray::view()</code> 提供零拷贝访问，但<strong>必须注意 <code>memory.grow</code> 后视图失效</strong>的问题。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"内存管理","id":"内存管理"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"线性内存共享","id":"线性内存共享"},{"level":2,"text":"js-sys 与 web-sys","id":"js-sys-与-web-sys"},{"level":2,"text":"字符串与数组传递","id":"字符串与数组传递"},{"level":2,"text":"serde-wasm-bindgen","id":"serde-wasm-bindgen"},{"level":2,"text":"Typed Arrays 与零拷贝","id":"typed-arrays-与零拷贝"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"wasm-pack 打包工具","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/webassembly/rust-to-wasm/wasm-pack"},"next":{"title":"调试 WASM","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/webassembly/rust-to-wasm/debugging-wasm"}}